      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this change necessary?  \n\nThis patch does not currently use the resulting `target.domain_id` value in the `identity:list_domain_roles` policy.\n\nIf we need to check the domain_id in the policy, then the filter parameter already ensures that the domain specified in a query string is part of the `policy_dict` [1] and can already be used to enforce policy.\n\n[1] https://opendev.org/openstack/keystone/src/branch/master/keystone/common/rbac_enforcer/enforcer.py#L372-L378",
      "range": {
