      "writtenOn": "2024-08-02T20:34:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`role:manager` here is only a partial check for a domain-manager, since it only checks that the token has the \"manager\" role, but does not ensure the token is domain-scoped.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 24,
        "startChar": 51,
        "endLine": 24,
