      "writtenOn": "2024-08-05T15:13:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thank you for the detailed writeup! It really helps to understand the whole situation.\n\nA project-scoped token does not seem to present a domain_id in the token context, so I implemented a check in the policy rule above to only accept the manager role when the domain_id is also present. This circumvents the whole tricky part about not having a domain-scoped target to check the id against. Would this suffice from your point of view?",
